      "t": "p",
      "x": "In hospitality, the space is part of the product. A tired bar top, worn floors or a cramped layout shows up in reviews and in how long guests stay. But every day closed is a day without revenue, so knowing when to renovate a restaurant or bar matters as much as the design of any hospitality renovation in Winnipeg, MB."
